Third-party components and compatibility (NOT YET VERIFIED)
-----------------------------------------------------------
This project is designed to interoperate with, or optionally bundle,
third-party photogrammetry engines and machine-learning models. Their
licenses have NOT been checked in this scaffold and MUST be verified before
any public release or redistribution:

  - Structure-from-Motion / MVS engines (e.g. COLMAP, OpenDroneMap, and
    others) — each has its own license; confirm the exact license of the
    specific version used and whether bundling is permitted.
  - Learned depth / reconstruction model weights — weights frequently carry
    licenses distinct from their code (research-only, non-commercial, or
    attribution requirements). Do not assume Apache-2.0 compatibility.
  - Any GUI toolkit, geometry kernel, or numerical library eventually chosen.

Do not represent any of the above as Apache-2.0-compatible until the exact
license text and version have been confirmed and recorded here.
